      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あの……僕の頭って、\nいつになったら元に戻るんでしょうか。\nまさか、ずっとこのままってことは……。",
      "jp_sha256": "0e77b0d8bc1b059b957b011f98a9d098231e57890556b09a11a1a94a612b23a6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "저기…… 제 머리는\n언제쯤 원래대로 돌아올까요?\n설마 계속 이대로인 건…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "25f159f32593bb106a43bd2a8f88978b461856207634b2ea7d3816045a7a72a5:000000_-7041387897793223436:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "あの……僕の頭って、\nいつになったら元に戻るんでしょうか。\nまさか、ずっとこのままってことは……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
